# KernelSU

GlitchCore-KRNL includes built-in support for:

**KernelSU-Next Legacy v3.2.0**

Current status:

```
KernelSU Version
----------------
v3.2.0-legacy

Hook Mode
---------
Manual

Driver
------
Built-In

Status
------
Working
```

The recommended Manager APK is included inside this repository:

```
extras/KernelSU-Next/
└── KernelSU_Next_v3.2.0_33129-release.apk
```

For best compatibility use the bundled Manager.

Newer Manager releases may incorrectly report that the legacy driver is missing.

